CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyIntro::
    .string "Hi, you're a new face!\p"
    .string "Only those Trainers who have a policy\n"
    .string "about Pokémon can turn pro.\p"
    .string "I may look cute, but I don't go easy\n"
    .string "on anyone!\p"
    .string "My policy is an all-out offensive with\n"
    .string "Water-type Pokémon!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_RulesExplain::
    .string "However, there are some boring rules\n"
    .string "we have to follow.\p"
    .string "We'll need three Pokémon each. No\n"
    .string "more, no less. Don't ask me why.\p"
    .string "I'm not about to fight unfair, so get\n"
    .string "your team sorted.\p"
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}Do you want to open the Storage\n"
    .string "System to organize your party?$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyReady::
    .string "Great! Finally you've adjusted your\n"
    .string "party.\p"
    .string "Then let's not waste any more time!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_Refused::
    .string "Come back when you have exactly\n"
    .string "three Pokémon!\p"
    .string "I only battle serious Trainers.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_StillNot3::
    .string "Hey! You still don't have exactly\n"
    .string "three Pokémon.\p"
    .string "Don't keep me waiting!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyDefeat::
    .string "Wow! You're too much!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_BadgeDelivery1::
    .string "All right!\p"
    .string "You can have the Cascade Badge to\n"
    .string "show you beat me.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_BadgeDelivery2::
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{PLAYER} received the Cascade Badge\n"
    .string "from Misty!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_BadgeDelivery3::
    .string "The Cascade Badge makes all Pokémon\n"
    .string "up to Lv. 30 obey.\p"
    .string "That includes even outsiders you got\n"
    .string "in trades.\p"
    .string "There's more. You can now use Cut\n"
    .string "anytime, even out of battle.\p"
    .string "You can Cut down small trees to open\n"
    .string "new pathways.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_TakeThisWithYou::
    .string "You can also have my favorite TM.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM03FromMisty::
    .string "{PLAYER} received TM03\n"
    .string "from Misty.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM03::
    .string "TM03 teaches Water Pulse.\p"
    .string "Use it on an aquatic Pokémon!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyPostBattle::
    .string "I just can't believe I lost to a\n"
    .string "rookie like you.\p"
    .string "There are many strong Trainers in the\n"
    .string "world.\p"
    .string "You'd better train hard so you don't\n"
    .string "lose to anyone else!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyRematchIntro::
    .string "Well, well, well… look who it is!\p"
    .string "The big Champion, strolling into my\n"
    .string "Gym just like that.\p"
    .string "Hah! I'm just teasing. Relax.\n"
    .string "It's really good to see you.\p"
    .string "You're nothing like you were back\n"
    .string "when we first battled.\p"
    .string "And lucky for you, neither am I!\p"
    .string "You think I'm all reckless waves?\n"
    .string "The tide can wait you out, too.\p"
    .string "Don't expect the same result twice.\n"
    .string "I've been itching for a real battle!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyRematchRules::
    .string "Oh, almost forgot! The League has us\n"
    .string "doing Double Battles now.\p"
    .string "Two Pokémon per side, all at once.\n"
    .string "Twice the chaos, twice the fun!\p"
    .string "So bring me four of your best.\n"
    .string "No holding back, got it?\p"
    .string "I want to see what the Champion is\n"
    .string "really made of.\p"
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}Do you want to open the Storage\n"
    .string "System to organize your party?$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyRematchReady::
    .string "Finally! Four Pokémon, all set.\n"
    .string "Quit stalling and let's go!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_RefusedRematch::
    .string "Scared of a little splash? I'm not\n"
    .string "letting you off that easy.\p"
    .string "Come back when you've grown a spine,\n"
    .string "and we'll settle this!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_StillNot4::
    .string "Hey! That's not four Pokémon. Did you\n"
    .string "even count?\p"
    .string "You'll need exactly four to do this.\n"
    .string "Now hurry up, I'm waiting!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyRematchDefeat::
    .string "Beaten again?!\n"
    .string "Guess you're just too good.\p"
    .string "You read me like a sailor reads the\n"
    .string "tides.\p"
    .string "That's Champion material! I'm proud of\n"
    .string "how far you've come.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyRematchBeforeReward::
    .string "Hold on, you deserve something for\n"
    .string "this performance. Here.$"

 CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyRematchAfterReward::   
    .string "It'll help you weather the hardest\n"
    .string "hits and keep swimming.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyRematchPostBattle::
    .string "You really learned how to dive deep\n"
    .string "with this battling thing, huh?\p"
    .string "Best showdown I've had in ages.\n"
    .string "Glad you stopped by!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyPostRematch::
    .string "Go on, Champion. Big important stuff\n"
    .string "to do, I guess. Don't be a stranger!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_BetterMakeRoomForThis::
    .string "Hey! You better make room for this!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_RematchNotEnoughPlaceholder::
    .string "$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_OfferPCRetrieve::
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}Do you want to open the Storage\n"
    .string "System to retrieve your full team?$"

@Last line related to Misty

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_DianaIntro::
    .string "What? You?\n"
    .string "I'm more than good enough for you!\p"
    .string "Misty won't have to be bothered.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_DianaDefeat::
    .string "You overwhelmed me!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_DianaPostBattle::
    .string "You have to face other Trainers\n"
    .string "to see how good you really are.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LuisIntro::
    .string "Splash!\p"
    .string "I'm first up!\n"
    .string "Let's do it!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LuisDefeat::
    .string "That can't be!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LuisPostBattle::
    .string "Misty is a Trainer who's going to\n"
    .string "keep improving.\p"
    .string "She won't lose to someone like you!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice::
    .string "Yo!\n"
    .string "Champ in the making!\p"
    .string "Let me give you some advice!\p"
    .string "The , Misty, is a pro who\n"
    .string "uses Water-type Pokémon.\p"
    .string "You can drain all their water with\n"
    .string "Grass-type Pokémon.\p"
    .string "Or, you might use Electric-type\n"
    .string "Pokémon and zap them!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_WeMakePrettyGoodTeam::
    .string "You beat Misty!\n"
    .string "See, what'd I tell ya?\p"
    .string "You and me, kid, we make a pretty\n"
    .string "darn-good team!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue::
    .string "Cerulean Pokémon Gym\n"
    .string "Leader: Misty\p"
    .string "Winning Trainers:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon::
    .string "Cerulean Pokémon Gym\n"
    .string "Leader: Misty\p"
    .string "Winning Trainers:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$"
